WEBVTT

00:00:29.484 --> 00:00:32.860
<v><b>M:</b></v> The Pan-American Highway is the longest.

00:00:33.646 --> 00:00:38.780
Highway 1 Australia is longer than the Trans-Siberian Highway.

00:01:05.348 --> 00:01:07.580
<v><b>M:</b></v> Everest is the highest.

00:01:08.599 --> 00:01:12.060
K2 is higher than Kilimanjaro.

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:41.140
<v><b>F:</b></v> Tokyo is the most crowded.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:45.460
Delhi is more crowded than Shanghai.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:15.380
<v><b>F:</b></v> Atlanta airport is the busiest.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:21.100
Istanbul airport is busier than Mexico City airport.

00:02:47.551 --> 00:02:50.260
<v><b>M:</b></v> The Louvre is the most popular.

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:56.660
The British Museum is more popular than the Metropolitan Museum of Art.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.780
<v><b>F:</b></v> Dhaka is the noisiest.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:31.260
Ho Chi Min City is noisier than New York.